%% aoneahsan-cccs-story-humanize — score, then rewrite what failed
flowchart TD
    trigger([Finalize, a lint report,<br/>or "make it sound human"]) --> mode{Mode?}
    mode -->|score| det[Deterministic half:<br/>burstiness · range · banned phrases ·<br/>dashes · not-X-but-Y · triplets ·<br/>openers · throat-clearing / summary]
    det --> judg[Judgment half:<br/>specificity · point of view · hedging ·<br/>voice match vs fingerprint · palette]
    judg --> sheet[Score sheet: pass / fail / allowed per row]
    sheet --> anyfail{Any FAIL?}
    anyfail -->|no| pass([PASS — name the fingerprint checked against])
    anyfail -->|yes| rewrite
    mode -->|rewrite| rewrite[Fix flagged criteria only:<br/>split / merge for rhythm · plain word for banned ·<br/>cut before adding]
    rewrite --> fact{Would a fix need<br/>a new fact?}
    fact -->|yes| nd[NEEDS DECISION — stop]
    fact -->|no| diff[Diff summary: change → criterion]
    diff --> det

    det -.same list.-> banned[(aoneahsan-cccs-story-craft/assets/banned-phrases.txt)]
    det -.same computation.-> hook[(global-config/hooks/posttooluse-story-lint.sh)]

    classDef gate fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    class mode,anyfail,fact gate
    class trigger,pass terminal
